[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0010","text":"（啊～指尖……\n　还是没能注意到啊——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0020","text":"1，2，3……————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0030","text":"结华～～～！\n辛苦了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0040","text":"小糸！\n谢谢你过来，好开心哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0050","text":"那当然啦～\n我说了会来的嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0060","text":"然后……给！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0070","text":"诶，连慰问品都有？\n可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0080","text":"这是我给你的，\n不用客气收下吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0090","text":"谢谢你，小糸……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700400_04_0100","text":"……好温暖啊——……"}]
